#. de: Mit Hildibrand in Radz-at-Han sprechen
#. fr: Parler à Hildibrand, à Radz-at-Han
#. kind: objective
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/047/ChrHdb842_04755:TEXT_CHRHDB842_04755_TODO_05:1"
msgid "Speak with Hildibrand in Radz<hyphen>at<hyphen>Han."
msgstr ""

